    <briefdescription>
<para>Simulated shard participant with configurable fault injection. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Supports:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>vote override (vote_yes)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>pre-commit override (precommit_ok)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>artificial network delay</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>partition flag (causes every request to fail)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>lock table for orphan-detection tests </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
